00:24:25.800 --> 00:24:30.000
and plan for what will come in the future

00:24:30.680 --> 00:24:33.120
Unemployment doesn't mean

00:24:33.680 --> 00:24:35.680
that we don't need workforce

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:37.120
or we don't have potential

00:24:37.120 --> 00:24:38.640
like poor countries, no.

00:24:39.120 --> 00:24:42.960
It is only a bad planning in the product

00:24:42.960 --> 00:24:45.000
in workforce supply

00:24:45.680 --> 00:24:48.280
and I would like to praise the Vision

00:24:49.160 --> 00:24:51.480
