female unemployment rate was really very high

00:25:34.440 --> 00:25:36.920
Before 5,6 years was

00:25:37.400 --> 00:25:38.680
34%

00:25:38.920 --> 00:25:39.600
imagine that

00:25:39.920 --> 00:25:40.920
more than a third

00:25:40.920 --> 00:25:44.560
of female workforce is unemployed

00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:47.000
If we say unemployed

00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:49.754
that means a person who is

00:25:49.754 --> 00:25:50.760
of working age

00:25:50.960 --> 00:25:52.480
and able to work

00:25:53.000 --> 00:25:54.120
able to work,

00:25:54.120 --> 00:25:55.360
 and looking for work

00:25:55.360 --> 00:25:57.360
but can't find it

00:25:57.360 --> 00:26:01.000
which means, that the 34% are

00:26:01.000 --> 00:26:01.960
of work age,

00:26:02.160 --> 00:26:03.600
they want to work,

00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:05.480
looking for job

00:26:05.960 --> 00:26:07.440
but they can't find it.

00:26:07.960 --> 00:26:09.880
this percentage dropped

00:26:10.800 --> 00:26:12.400
in 2020

00:26:13.920 --> 00:26:15.720
to 22%

00:26:16.760 --> 00:26:17.260
you can notice

00:26:17.600 --> 00:26:18.760
it's a big percentage

00:26:19.240 --> 00:26:21.960
22% is high, of course

00:26:22.440 --> 00:26:25.000
but it's a huge achievement

00:26:25.560 --> 00:26:28.040
and is unexpected

00:26:28.040 --> 00:26:30.680
There are considerable efforts in this topic

00:26:31.120 --> 00:26:32.880
in women's empowerment in the labor market

00:26:32.880 --> 00:26:33.920
remove obstacles,

00:26:33.920 --> 00:26:37.080
Allow driving cars for women,

00:26:37.080 --> 00:26:38.840
which help them to access their work easily

00:26:38.840 --> 00:26:39.960
Anti-Harassment Law

00:26:41.080 --> 00:26:43.080
Not requiring the guardian consent anymore

00:26:43.080 --> 00:26:44.720
for her to work

00:26:45.200 --> 00:26:46.360
Opening new sectors

00:26:46.360 --> 00:26:47.400
that were not available to her

00:26:47.400 --> 00:26:47.900
All of these things

00:26:47.900 --> 00:26:49.900
led to a huge jump in this number

00:26:49.900 --> 00:26:50.825
as you said

00:26:50.825 --> 00:26:52.825
and it's a wonderful achievement

00:26:52.825 --> 00:26:53.400
The question here

00:26:53.400 --> 00:26:54.480
since the episode focuses

00:26:54.480 --> 00:26:56.520
on the social aspect

00:26:57.000 --> 00:26:57.960
What is the impact

00:26:58.360 --> 00:27:00.000
of this huge jump

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:02.080
on the social aspects

00:27:03.000 --> 00:27:04.680
Because there is a lot of arguments

00:27:04.680 --> 00:27:05.200
today on Twitter

00:27:05.200 --> 00:27:06.360
Maybe you follow it

00:27:06.760 --> 00:27:11.800
A lot of people link divorce cases for example,

00:27:11.800 --> 00:27:14.760
fertility rates with female work

00:27:15.320 --> 00:27:16.400
First, is this linking accurate?

00:27:16.840 --> 00:27:19.520
Second, we go back to the previous question

00:27:19.760 --> 00:27:21.640
What is the social impact

00:27:22.280 --> 00:27:23.960
for the vast jump

00:27:23.960 --> 00:27:25.920
of women's participation in the labor market?

00:27:27.480 --> 00:27:28.920
Female  participation

00:27:28.920 --> 00:27:31.280
in the labor market must have an impact

00:27:31.280 --> 00:27:33.760
but from the economic side,

00:27:34.000 --> 00:27:36.000
it is difficult for half of society

00:27:36.000 --> 00:27:37.400
to be unemployed

00:27:37.840 --> 00:27:39.120
and at the same time,

00:27:39.120 --> 00:27:41.560
we hire women from outside of the Kingdom

00:27:42.200 --> 00:27:43.840
we hire workforce for jobs

00:27:44.000 --> 00:27:45.680
that women can perform

00:27:46.520 --> 00:27:48.040
and there are some poor families

00:27:48.040 --> 00:27:51.480
who need female labor face

00:27:51.760 --> 00:27:52.680
to support their income

00:27:52.920 --> 00:27:54.960
Some families don't have sons

00:27:55.400 --> 00:27:57.840
thus, women's participation

00:27:57.840 --> 00:27:58.800
is a positive aspect

00:27:59.400 --> 00:28:01.240
very positive aspect

00:28:01.240 --> 00:28:04.480
but we have to create institutions

00:28:05.080 --> 00:28:06.760
that save women,

00:28:07.040 --> 00:28:08.440
save families,

00:28:08.440 --> 00:28:09.960
support families...

00:28:09.960 --> 00:28:10.460
How?

00:28:10.460 --> 00:28:11.920
For example,

00:28:13.520 --> 00:28:16.480
provide affordable kindergartens,

00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:20.320
flexible working hours

00:28:20.320 --> 00:28:21.360
for some women

00:28:21.600 --> 00:28:22.760
remote work

00:28:25.600 --> 00:28:27.680
There are many things

00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:30.000
that can be done

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:33.760
without impacting family structure

00:28:33.760 --> 00:28:35.400
Is this linking correct?

00:28:35.400 --> 00:28:36.800
her participation in the labor market.......

00:28:36.800 --> 00:28:37.900
Ok, agreed that it has

00:28:37.900 --> 00:28:39.600
a positive economic impact

00:28:39.840 --> 00:28:40.680
but many link

00:28:40.680 --> 00:28:44.160
it to the negative social impact

00:28:44.560 --> 00:28:45.440
Is this linking accurate?

00:28:46.480 --> 00:28:47.080
In my opinion,

00:28:47.080 --> 00:28:48.675
there are pros and cons

00:28:48.675 --> 00:28:51.080
and there must be cons Give me examples?

00:28:51.080 --> 00:28:52.760
As, increase divorce cases

00:28:54.320 --> 00:28:54.800
What is the relation

00:28:54.800 --> 00:28:56.994
between female work and increasing divorce?

00:28:56.994 --> 00:28:57.494
As reproductive, that we talked about.

00:28:57.494 --> 00:28:58.810
Ok.

00:28:58.810 --> 00:29:00.144
Can you explain,

00:29:00.144 --> 00:29:02.240
what is the relation between her work

00:29:02.960 --> 00:29:03.480
and divorce?

00:29:03.480 --> 00:29:05.000
her work and delayed reproductive?

00:29:05.640 --> 00:29:07.000
Delayed reproductive is obvious.

00:29:07.400 --> 00:29:11.960
This is no-brainer

00:29:11.960 --> 00:29:13.720
If she is working, especially

00:29:13.720 --> 00:29:15.720
if she is ambitious and wants

00:29:15.720 --> 00:29:18.000
to work more hours

00:29:19.360 --> 00:29:21.640
It would be at the expense

00:29:21.640 --> 00:29:22.920
of her decision for reproductive

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:25.760
It's unreasonable to stand out

00:29:25.760 --> 00:29:27.800
in her work as a manager or president

00:29:27.800 --> 00:29:29.800
in a company or so...

00:29:29.800 --> 00:29:31.200
and at the same time,

00:29:31.200 --> 00:29:33.520
give birth to a child every year or two

00:29:34.440 --> 00:29:35.240
It is almost impossible.

00:29:35.240 --> 00:29:36.200
This link is obvious.

00:29:36.200 --> 00:29:37.040
Yes.

00:29:37.040 --> 00:29:38.720
What is the link to divorce?

00:29:38.720 --> 00:29:42.120
For divorce, I think the society

00:29:42.120 --> 00:29:45.316
needs a little change

00:29:45.840 --> 00:29:47.483
because some husbands

00:29:47.483 --> 00:29:49.440
do not accept female work.

00:29:49.920 --> 00:29:52.240
especially in a mixed environment

00:29:54.000 --> 00:29:55.840
this strains the relation

00:29:56.240 --> 00:29:58.720
for some people

00:30:01.080 --> 00:30:02.600
and maybe it leads to divorce

00:30:02.600 --> 00:30:03.920
if the woman insists on working

00:30:03.920 --> 00:30:05.520
in a certain environment

00:30:05.520 --> 00:30:07.320
that her husband may not like

00:30:07.320 --> 00:30:11.600
but I assume this is a transformational stage

00:30:14.120 --> 00:30:16.440
However, if we look at divorce statistics,

00:30:17.160 --> 00:30:19.200
we find that there is a rise

00:30:19.200 --> 00:30:22.320
in divorce rates over the past years

00:30:23.520 --> 00:30:26.320
so that the divorce ratio

00:30:26.880 --> 00:30:29.680
has reached 38%

00:30:29.680 --> 00:30:32.520
For every 10 marriages, 3 divorces

00:30:32.800 --> 00:30:33.200
Yes

00:30:33.200 --> 00:30:35.860
It's a high percentage

00:30:35.860 --> 00:30:39.200
Before 10 years, it was 23%

00:30:40.240 --> 00:30:42.880
This is an exponential decrease.

00:30:43.240 --> 00:30:45.320
I interpret this raise as

00:30:47.040 --> 00:30:48.920
a corrective condition

00:30:49.320 --> 00:30:52.440
Society lives in a corrective stage

00:30:52.880 --> 00:30:54.160
How to correct?

00:30:54.200 --> 00:30:55.080
I'm going to quote something

00:30:55.080 --> 00:30:56.280
related to this situation

00:30:56.480 --> 00:30:59.500
You have a fantastic article which was the reason to know you

00:30:59.500 --> 00:31:03.160
so, I appreciate it and I recommend it for reading

00:31:03.480 --> 00:31:05.709
which was in December 2018, titled

00:31:05.709 --> 00:31:09.800
"Social Change and Saudi Society in Light of 2030"

00:31:10.640 --> 00:31:11.920
and summarised a set of results

00:31:11.920 --> 00:31:15.560
or expected changes in the vision

00:31:15.560 --> 00:31:17.840
and its economic and social dynamics

00:31:18.080 --> 00:31:19.600
among your mentioned changes

00:31:19.600 --> 00:31:20.906
I quote your words:

00:31:20.906 --> 00:31:22.280
"Women's earn income

00:31:22.880 --> 00:31:24.360
 will lead to their independence,

00:31:24.880 --> 00:31:27.760
which will reshape roles within the family"

00:31:27.760 --> 00:31:28.320
right

00:31:28.560 --> 00:31:30.280
and this has a relationship with

00:31:30.440 --> 00:31:32.280
our discussion a while ago about the divorce

00:31:32.280 --> 00:31:36.560
Explain how woman's income increase

00:31:37.560 --> 00:31:39.680
to change her role in the family?

00:31:40.160 --> 00:31:42.720
Because the traditional style

00:31:43.000 --> 00:31:45.000
is the dependence of wife on her husband.

00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:50.120
The financial and l iving dependency

00:31:50.120 --> 00:31:53.560
on the husband have a negative side to certain degree

00:31:54.240 --> 00:31:58.280
especially in unsuccessful marital relationship

00:31:58.280 --> 00:31:59.400
because it makes women

00:31:59.400 --> 00:32:00.960
live in injustice.

00:32:00.960 --> 00:32:04.360
She has to live with a man

00:32:04.360 --> 00:32:05.920
she can't tolerate

00:32:06.800 --> 00:32:08.320
The availability of options like

00:32:08.320 --> 00:32:10.240
work and others

00:32:10.240 --> 00:32:14.360
relief her from unsuccessful married

00:32:14.360 --> 00:32:19.600
that may insult her dignity

00:32:20.480 --> 00:32:22.680
and this is a positive side

00:32:22.680 --> 00:32:26.880
Though divorce is not recommended,

00:32:26.880 --> 00:32:28.480
but sometimes it is a solution

00:32:28.480 --> 00:32:32.200
for living a good and decent life

00:32:32.200 --> 00:32:34.480
So, the increase in divorce cases now

00:32:34.480 --> 00:32:35.840
as a result of female work

00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:37.520
I see it .....

00:32:37.960 --> 00:32:38.960
pursuit of an option

00:32:38.960 --> 00:32:39.920
that was not previously available

00:32:39.920 --> 00:32:41.680
and it is a corrective situation

00:32:42.360 --> 00:32:44.280
means a corrective step

00:32:45.000 --> 00:32:46.160
which can be positive

00:32:46.160 --> 00:32:47.240
In the future,

00:32:47.480 --> 00:32:49.400
because of changes in life patterns,

00:32:49.400 --> 00:32:51.259
roles and values.

00:32:51.259 --> 00:32:53.640
Social values will change

00:32:53.640 --> 00:32:55.360
as part of the huge social change

00:32:55.360 --> 00:32:56.760
that Saudi society goes through

00:32:57.240 --> 00:32:59.120
This corrective step means

00:32:59.120 --> 00:33:01.840
that unsuccessful marriages

00:33:01.840 --> 00:33:03.360
can correct their situation

00:33:03.360 --> 00:33:05.400
because the regulations allow

00:33:05.680 --> 00:33:06.880
and encourage..

00:33:06.880 --> 00:33:08.930
In the past, there were women live.. 

00:33:08.930 --> 00:33:20.680
let's say, miserable life because they can't get out

00:33:20.680 --> 00:33:23.280
of the golden cage or the metal cage

00:33:24.720 --> 00:33:26.560
The regulations enable her to do so now

00:33:27.160 --> 00:33:28.080
It's not the regulations only,

00:33:28.080 --> 00:33:28.880
having income!

00:33:30.080 --> 00:33:31.080
Yes, having income also

00:33:31.080 --> 00:33:32.520
give her independence

00:33:32.520 --> 00:33:35.520
of course, there is no change

00:33:35.520 --> 00:33:37.336
without victims

00:33:38.360 --> 00:33:39.245
Even the Vision

00:33:39.245 --> 00:33:43.640
has a comprehending that society change has victims

00:33:43.640 --> 00:33:46.120
for that, we have Citizen's Account

00:33:46.120 --> 00:33:50.360
and others came to ease

00:33:50.600 --> 00:33:52.680
the impact of change

00:33:52.680 --> 00:33:53.920
on some families

00:33:54.280 --> 00:33:56.640
so, there will be a change

00:33:56.640 --> 00:33:58.240
on families and children

00:33:58.240 --> 00:34:01.320
because the society after going through

00:34:01.320 --> 00:34:04.120
the change step

00:34:04.120 --> 00:34:05.400
some values are messed up

00:34:05.720 --> 00:34:06.600
The society sometimes

00:34:06.600 --> 00:34:10.120
lives in a case of value chaos

00:34:10.120 --> 00:34:11.880
and some people understand that

00:34:11.880 --> 00:34:13.440
the values are disturbed

00:34:13.720 --> 00:34:15.440
The old values have been disrubted

00:34:15.440 --> 00:34:20.633
and the society create new values

00:34:21.080 --> 00:34:22.633
which takes a time

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:24.760
It go through a period of value chaos

00:34:24.760 --> 00:34:26.520
Then, start to create values

00:34:26.840 --> 00:34:29.040
 may differ from the previous values

00:34:29.440 --> 00:34:31.280
and this is the nature of societies

00:34:31.280 --> 00:34:34.040
We are not alone on this planet

00:34:34.280 --> 00:34:36.040
In the same article, you said

00:34:36.040 --> 00:34:38.040
"Among changes there will be a leap...

00:34:38.040 --> 00:34:40.880
a leap of change in values

00:34:41.720 --> 00:34:43.800
and society must harmonise with it,

00:34:44.200 --> 00:34:46.240
adjust it and reconcile with it

00:34:46.240 --> 00:34:46.798
over time

00:34:47.480 --> 00:34:48.880
and education is the magic key"

00:34:48.880 --> 00:34:54.522
One of the negative things for me

00:34:54.522 --> 00:34:56.522
through following the vision...

00:34:56.522 --> 00:34:59.600
There was a value program

00:34:59.600 --> 00:35:00.000
Which was called

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:01.600
Develop Citizens' Capabilities Program

00:35:01.600 --> 00:35:02.200
Right

00:35:04.000 --> 00:35:07.400
It was available, had targets and team

00:35:07.400 --> 00:35:11.120
Then, it suddenly evaporated

00:35:11.120 --> 00:35:13.120
or vanished

00:35:13.120 --> 00:35:14.040
Now, it's added to the

00:35:14.320 --> 00:35:15.920
Human Capability Development Program

00:35:15.920 --> 00:35:21.480
but we don't see formal

00:35:21.480 --> 00:35:22.480
or obvious efforts

00:35:22.480 --> 00:35:24.720
of instilling values,

00:35:26.720 --> 00:35:27.800
What is the role of the family,

00:35:27.800 --> 00:35:29.000
for me as a head of the family?

00:35:30.480 --> 00:35:31.480
previously, we were dependent

00:35:31.480 --> 00:35:32.120
on the country

00:35:32.120 --> 00:35:32.720
to do everything,

00:35:32.720 --> 00:35:34.120
education, raising children,

00:35:34.120 --> 00:35:35.434
teach us how to pray,

00:35:35.434 --> 00:35:37.360
close shops until we go to pray,

00:35:37.360 --> 00:35:38.600
and do everything on our behalf

00:35:38.600 --> 00:35:39.480
Right

00:35:39.480 --> 00:35:40.880
A lot of these roles became

00:35:41.640 --> 00:35:42.320
your responsibility today

00:35:42.640 --> 00:35:43.360
 as a head of the family

00:35:43.360 --> 00:35:45.840
father, mother, and sons

00:35:46.320 --> 00:35:49.320
The lack of a formal effort

00:35:49.320 --> 00:35:51.320
to cultivate certain values

00:35:51.560 --> 00:35:53.320
I am the head of the family

00:35:53.320 --> 00:35:55.320
what can I do?

00:35:55.320 --> 00:36:00.480
The ball is in the court of the head of the family

00:36:00.640 --> 00:36:02.960
In the past, the goverment instructed to pray

00:36:02.960 --> 00:36:03.800
or not to pray

00:36:03.800 --> 00:36:07.240
I mean, it didn't say don't pray

00:36:08.600 --> 00:36:10.680
Wear your abaya in certain way

00:36:10.680 --> 00:36:12.320
It was a big responsibility

00:36:12.320 --> 00:36:14.520
Cover up and so on...

00:36:15.000 --> 00:36:17.720
 but now, the family have to

00:36:17.720 --> 00:36:18.920
cultivate the values

00:36:19.240 --> 00:36:23.960
in their children through good examples

00:36:24.000 --> 00:36:26.040
I mean, the role models

00:36:26.560 --> 00:36:29.400
So, if the father or brothers

00:36:29.400 --> 00:36:30.800
are good role models

00:36:30.800 --> 00:36:31.960
the family will be good

00:36:31.960 --> 00:36:33.920
and coexisting with itself

00:36:33.920 --> 00:36:36.440
and with society and not isolated

00:36:37.560 --> 00:36:38.880
protecting my family doesn't mean

00:36:38.880 --> 00:36:41.280
isloate it from the society

00:36:41.600 --> 00:36:42.960
Coexisting with society means

00:36:42.960 --> 00:36:45.120
understand the change,

00:36:45.120 --> 00:36:48.760
cultivate nobel values in children

00:36:49.040 --> 00:36:52.760
and this is a significant effort

00:36:52.760 --> 00:36:53.920
we can talk about it easily

00:36:54.160 --> 00:36:55.760
but when it comes to application, it is difficult

00:36:56.000 --> 00:36:57.480
Are they reasons for not to have

00:36:57.800 --> 00:37:00.000
or reduce parents desire to

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:00.800
reproductive

00:37:00.800 --> 00:37:03.240
because there is parenting load today

00:37:03.520 --> 00:37:04.400
We don't have this problem in the past

00:37:04.400 --> 00:37:05.680
the society helps in raising children up,

00:37:05.680 --> 00:37:06.280
 everything was under control

00:37:06.280 --> 00:37:07.760
and everything prohibited wasn't accessible

00:37:08.080 --> 00:37:10.320
so, we didn't face the same risk which

00:37:10.320 --> 00:37:10.800
exist today

00:37:10.800 --> 00:37:12.000
Do you think this is part of it?

00:37:12.360 --> 00:37:14.360
I think so

00:37:14.360 --> 00:37:16.240
My son said you are lucky

00:37:16.440 --> 00:37:17.280
Why?

00:37:17.760 --> 00:37:18.840
He said you are lucky

00:37:18.840 --> 00:37:21.280
because you raised your children already

00:37:21.520 --> 00:37:23.320
He said raising children is difficult now

00:37:23.960 --> 00:37:25.160
Indeed, it won't be easy

00:37:25.440 --> 00:37:27.160
However, we are not used to

00:37:27.160 --> 00:37:30.000
 cultivate the correct values

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:32.200
We delegated it to others,

00:37:32.200 --> 00:37:33.280
delegated it to others

00:37:33.280 --> 00:37:34.920
Now, it is your responsibility

00:37:35.640 --> 00:37:36.920
and you have to tolerate it

00:37:36.920 --> 00:37:39.400
Because if the government to step in

00:37:39.680 --> 00:37:42.520
in some matters related to behavior...

00:37:42.520 --> 00:37:46.480
The government has its regulations,

00:37:46.720 --> 00:37:48.400
legislates and sets regulations

00:37:48.400 --> 00:37:51.800
so, you don't affect others' lives

00:37:52.040 --> 00:37:54.000
and you don't harm them

00:37:54.000 --> 00:37:57.288
but your life is your own

00:37:58.400 --> 00:38:01.920
This is the right direction

00:38:02.160 --> 00:38:04.080
because intervening in people's specifics

00:38:04.080 --> 00:38:06.520
by the formal institutions

00:38:06.520 --> 00:38:07.440
isn't appropriate

00:38:07.440 --> 00:38:09.120
There is a family responsibility

00:38:09.120 --> 00:38:10.680
and education has to

00:38:10.680 --> 00:38:13.120
contribute in cultivating

00:38:13.120 --> 00:38:14.120
the noble values

00:38:14.120 --> 00:38:21.160
The mosque also is put in the right direction

00:38:21.160 --> 00:38:22.400
to cultivate the values

