Islam religion advice for these...

00:41:55.160 --> 00:41:56.720
Fulfil the rights of the road!

00:41:56.720 --> 00:41:58.080
Fulfill the rights of the road,

00:41:58.080 --> 00:42:00.280
give others their rights,

00:42:00.280 --> 00:42:03.120
Avoid cheating  and fraud,

00:42:03.120 --> 00:42:03.800
"He who treats us dishonestly

00:42:03.800 --> 00:42:04.840
does not belong to us.”

