So, you feel that religious discourse

00:42:07.280 --> 00:42:10.320
doesn't focus on the dealings in the past

00:42:10.320 --> 00:42:11.400
It didn't focus on dealings,

00:42:11.400 --> 00:42:13.960
work devotion and quality of work

00:42:17.160 --> 00:42:20.880
thus, I feel that religious discourse

00:42:20.880 --> 00:42:22.160
has a role in cultivating the values

00:42:22.160 --> 00:42:23.590
that we discuss now

00:42:23.590 --> 00:42:25.320
the role of the mosque,

00:42:25.520 --> 00:42:27.566
it should have a positive role

00:42:27.566 --> 00:42:32.880
which isn't like the past forcing people to pray

00:42:32.880 --> 00:42:39.440
if they can't due to circumstances, preventing them

00:42:39.440 --> 00:42:42.560
the mosque, the school and education

