Education should play a more significant role

00:42:45.240 --> 00:42:47.600
in cultivating nobel value

00:42:47.800 --> 00:42:51.080
not only teaching students

00:42:51.360 --> 00:42:53.280
We have to cultivate the nobel values

00:42:53.280 --> 00:42:54.880
in young generation

