so, I beleive it's affected education greatly

00:43:55.880 --> 00:43:57.320
Among the changes that you mentioned

00:43:57.320 --> 00:43:58.440
in the same article,

00:44:00.800 --> 00:44:05.400
"people accept and want to live in apartments"

