00:44:13.240 --> 00:44:18.200
In the past and now, people prefer

00:44:18.200 --> 00:44:19.440
to live in a wide place

00:44:20.040 --> 00:44:21.440
and this isn't strange

00:44:21.440 --> 00:44:22.800
because we came from a rural culture,

00:44:22.800 --> 00:44:24.560
where the wide spaces are

00:44:24.880 --> 00:44:25.880
We came from the desert,

00:44:25.880 --> 00:44:27.280
 as far as the eye can see,

00:44:28.000 --> 00:44:28.600
all is your home

00:44:29.160 --> 00:44:32.800
So, people used to live in big places,

00:44:33.560 --> 00:44:36.520
cosy homes, villas with large area

00:44:36.520 --> 00:44:38.200
Now, economic conditions,

00:44:38.200 --> 00:44:40.520
maintenance, etc

00:44:40.520 --> 00:44:43.280
make people live in apartments

00:44:43.280 --> 00:44:45.280
thus, the percentage of Saudi

00:44:46.240 --> 00:44:48.800
who living in apartments was small

00:44:49.040 --> 00:44:50.800
but their percentage increased now

00:44:50.800 --> 00:44:56.880
I think it's 34% now

00:44:56.880 --> 00:44:58.640
Even though I'm not sure

00:44:58.640 --> 00:45:02.320
may be 29 or 30% lives in villas

00:45:03.040 --> 00:45:08.120
30 or 34% in apartments

00:45:09.000 --> 00:45:11.760
so, there is a transformation

00:45:11.760 --> 00:45:14.240
Now, people have to live in ........

