is the motive financial?

00:45:16.920 --> 00:45:18.280
means, this is what I can do!

00:45:18.280 --> 00:45:20.215
or is it social?

00:45:20.215 --> 00:45:21.730
I do not need bigger than this!

00:45:21.730 --> 00:45:23.598
It is absolutely a financial motive

00:45:23.598 --> 00:45:26.240
means, if he finds a big house with lower maintenance costs

00:45:26.240 --> 00:45:26.840
he will take it?

00:45:27.080 --> 00:45:27.600
Definitely

00:45:27.600 --> 00:45:30.320
I think most of them will take the house

00:45:30.320 --> 00:45:33.880
Financial motive is the reason

00:45:34.160 --> 00:45:35.198
Therefore, you find

00:45:35.198 --> 00:45:38.231
this phenomenon clearer in Riyadh

00:45:38.231 --> 00:45:43.840
but in non-major cities, you'll find that villa is the choice

00:45:44.200 --> 00:45:44.700
right

00:45:45.440 --> 00:45:46.560
so, as the city is getting bigger

00:45:46.560 --> 00:45:48.240
as the cost increases

00:45:48.440 --> 00:45:49.720
thus, the idea of apartment appears

00:45:49.880 --> 00:45:50.520
right

00:45:50.520 --> 00:45:51.160
What is the relationship between apartments

00:45:51.160 --> 00:45:52.800
and nuclear families?

00:45:52.800 --> 00:45:55.520
You talked about transformation

00:45:55.520 --> 00:45:56.840
in the form of the Saudi family

00:45:56.840 --> 00:45:59.340
from a specific form to the nuclear family

00:45:59.340 --> 00:46:00.840
What do you mean

00:46:00.840 --> 00:46:01.360
and what is the relationship

00:46:01.360 --> 00:46:01.960
between it and apartments?

00:46:04.080 --> 00:46:06.560
Saudi family has a major transformation

00:46:06.560 --> 00:46:09.360
 change over the past 3 or 4 decades

00:46:09.840 --> 00:46:10.960
So, the family transformed from

00:46:10.960 --> 00:46:11.920
an extended family

00:46:11.920 --> 00:46:13.880
which has a husband, wife

00:46:13.880 --> 00:46:14.760
and their children

00:46:15.480 --> 00:46:17.920
brother also, parents,

00:46:18.240 --> 00:46:20.720
and maybe other relatives

00:46:21.000 --> 00:46:22.960
In the past,  brothers and their wives

00:46:22.960 --> 00:46:26.600
lived in the same house

00:46:28.360 --> 00:46:30.840
It could be a son and his parents

00:46:30.840 --> 00:46:32.840
This is called extended family?

00:46:32.840 --> 00:46:33.340
Extended family. Correct.

00:46:33.340 --> 00:46:34.400
They live in the same house.

00:46:34.400 --> 00:46:36.040
Means, it extends beyond the frame

00:46:36.040 --> 00:46:38.760
of husband, wife and children

00:46:39.080 --> 00:46:41.160
So, this  family started to turn

00:46:41.160 --> 00:46:43.000
into a nuclear family

00:46:43.000 --> 00:46:45.000
which means, husband wife and children

00:46:45.280 --> 00:46:46.380
due to many reasons,

00:46:46.380 --> 00:46:49.680
the economic factor, is a significant factor

00:46:49.960 --> 00:46:52.000
but there are other social factors

00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:54.200
people desires for living

00:46:54.200 --> 00:46:56.880
changed not like it in the past

00:46:57.160 --> 00:47:00.520
Son doesn't want to live in the same house

00:47:00.520 --> 00:47:01.680
 with his parents when he gets married

00:47:01.680 --> 00:47:04.040
even if that house is big

00:47:04.040 --> 00:47:04.540
like a palace

00:47:05.520 --> 00:47:06.540
He is going to look for

00:47:06.540 --> 00:47:07.920
a private house

00:47:07.920 --> 00:47:10.320
because the concept of building a family,

00:47:10.320 --> 00:47:13.012
privacy, the privacy of the family,

00:47:13.012 --> 00:47:14.320
husband and wife,

00:47:15.960 --> 00:47:18.173
culturally changed

00:47:19.400 --> 00:47:23.320
In the past, the wife accepted to live with parents in law

00:47:23.320 --> 00:47:26.360
 but now, most wives

00:47:26.360 --> 00:47:27.240
don't accept to live

00:47:27.240 --> 00:47:30.880
with their parents or brothers in law

00:47:31.280 --> 00:47:34.280
So,  this transformation caused

00:47:34.280 --> 00:47:37.160
a significant impact on raising children

00:47:37.160 --> 00:47:38.560
that we discussed a while ago

00:47:38.560 --> 00:47:40.800
on taking care of children

00:47:41.240 --> 00:47:42.960
on caring of elderlies

00:47:42.960 --> 00:47:46.520
It did a significant change

00:47:46.520 --> 00:47:50.200
in the feature of the family

00:47:51.120 --> 00:47:53.320
because there isn't somebody

00:47:53.320 --> 00:47:54.880
to help you in raising children

00:47:54.880 --> 00:47:59.280
or taking care of elderlies

00:47:59.280 --> 00:48:01.760
So, you have to live alone

00:48:02.320 --> 00:48:07.160
Thus, if you live in an apartment

00:48:07.440 --> 00:48:09.880
where husband and wife are work

00:48:10.080 --> 00:48:12.348
There will be a challenge

00:48:12.348 --> 00:48:17.800
in taking care of parents if they need

00:48:18.440 --> 00:48:23.720
which makes them hire a nurse

00:48:24.480 --> 00:48:26.400
All of these factors affected it

00:48:26.840 --> 00:48:29.520
Since the nuclear family is small

00:48:29.520 --> 00:48:31.000
which mostly has couple with a child

00:48:31.280 --> 00:48:34.680
this, also, encouraged acceptance

00:48:34.680 --> 00:48:35.400
of living in apartments

00:48:35.800 --> 00:48:37.800
because it's size is enough

00:48:37.800 --> 00:48:39.841
for small families

00:48:40.080 --> 00:48:41.080
Living in the city also

00:48:41.080 --> 00:48:43.480
and the role of an economic factor

00:48:43.480 --> 00:48:46.800
because cost of living is very expensive

00:48:47.680 --> 00:48:48.360
In the same context,

00:48:48.360 --> 00:48:49.960
the new family topic

00:48:50.360 --> 00:48:54.360
which number of children is very limited

00:48:54.360 --> 00:48:55.960
and it's related to our previous discussion

00:48:55.960 --> 00:48:56.800
about fertility rates

00:48:57.240 --> 00:48:59.400
Someone named Fahad Al-Harb said

00:48:59.720 --> 00:49:02.240
"Having more than 2 children is suicide."

00:49:03.120 --> 00:49:04.680
litraly

00:49:05.080 --> 00:49:07.400
I think this is an exaggeration!

00:49:07.720 --> 00:49:11.160
I know it differs from family to family

00:49:11.160 --> 00:49:13.362
and from person to person

00:49:13.362 --> 00:49:19.000
but what is the natural and healthy fertility rates for society?

00:49:22.080 --> 00:49:25.160
In demographics studies, there is something

00:49:25.160 --> 00:49:26.840
they call it, the desired number of children

00:49:26.840 --> 00:49:28.960
Studies of desired number

00:49:28.960 --> 00:49:29.340
have been done

00:49:29.340 --> 00:49:31.340
and should be conducted

00:49:31.560 --> 00:49:32.600
because it shows you

00:49:32.600 --> 00:49:34.720
the fertility rates trends in the future

00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:38.080
The desired number differs

00:49:38.440 --> 00:49:39.360
according to education,

00:49:40.200 --> 00:49:41.600
religiosity,

00:49:42.080 --> 00:49:43.600
place of inhabitance

00:49:43.600 --> 00:49:46.000
either in a rural or city,

00:49:50.320 --> 00:49:54.000
socialization, age

00:49:54.000 --> 00:49:56.280
There are many differences

00:49:56.560 --> 00:49:58.720
but what is the appropriate average?

00:49:58.920 --> 00:50:00.240
maybe this is your question,

00:50:00.480 --> 00:50:04.280
What is the optimal number per family?

00:50:05.280 --> 00:50:11.400
If I ask you, Rima and the audience

00:50:11.600 --> 00:50:13.880
you will give me different answers

00:50:13.880 --> 00:50:16.880
So, maybe I'm going to say 4 or 5

00:50:17.320 --> 00:50:20.400
but you encourage reproductive generally

00:50:20.400 --> 00:50:22.400
on your articles, tweets

00:50:22.400 --> 00:50:23.480
It's obvious

00:50:23.480 --> 00:50:27.480
I encourage reproductive with limits, not without limits

00:50:27.480 --> 00:50:28.480
What are your limits?

00:50:28.720 --> 00:50:32.600
For example, I suppose that having

00:50:32.600 --> 00:50:33.600
more than 4 children

00:50:33.880 --> 00:50:35.520
in this situation is large number

00:50:35.520 --> 00:50:36.380
large number?

00:50:36.380 --> 00:50:37.112
Nowadays, yes

00:50:37.112 --> 00:50:38.800
Though, my kids are more than 4 

00:50:38.800 --> 00:50:39.960
Masha 'Allah

00:50:39.960 --> 00:50:45.680
and less than 2 is few....

00:50:45.960 --> 00:50:46.480
which affected the substitution ratio badly

00:50:46.480 --> 00:50:46.840
little...

00:50:46.840 --> 00:50:50.120
but these concepts are

00:50:50.120 --> 00:50:53.760
a reflection of our culture

00:50:53.760 --> 00:50:55.560
Maybe if I meet you in a while

00:50:55.560 --> 00:50:56.600
again, Abu Abduarahman

00:50:56.600 --> 00:50:58.560
So, you change your mind

00:50:58.560 --> 00:50:59.000
It will change

00:50:59.000 --> 00:51:00.000
or you will say 7

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:03.600
Maybe I'll say like Al-harbi

00:51:04.080 --> 00:51:06.800
There is a crucial subject

00:51:06.800 --> 00:51:08.040
you talked about it a lot

00:51:08.440 --> 00:51:10.574
which is the  Demographic Gift

00:51:10.574 --> 00:51:13.320
and you had a lecture 

00:51:13.320 --> 00:51:14.440
The Saudi Arabian Society for r Culture and Arts in 2019

00:51:14.800 --> 00:51:16.360
You discussed this topic thoroughly

00:51:16.360 --> 00:51:18.960
Tell us about the demographic gift

00:51:18.960 --> 00:51:21.120
and why are we lucky in Saudi

00:51:21.120 --> 00:51:24.080
and have this temporary window?

00:51:24.480 --> 00:51:25.920
that if  we use it wisely

00:51:25.920 --> 00:51:27.720
it will have huge impact

00:51:27.720 --> 00:51:29.120
or vise versa

00:51:30.240 --> 00:51:31.560
The demographic gift

00:51:31.560 --> 00:51:35.200
doesn't happen a lot, it only happens once

00:51:35.800 --> 00:51:38.080
Now, most the Arab countries

00:51:38.080 --> 00:51:40.360
and Saudi Arabia, especially

00:51:40.360 --> 00:51:42.360
are live go on  in this demographics opportunity

00:51:42.360 --> 00:51:45.200
or demographics window

00:51:45.640 --> 00:51:46.920
and it occurs as a result of declining

00:51:46.920 --> 00:51:54.080
 fertility rates at steady fast rate

00:51:54.080 --> 00:51:57.800
with small elderlies percentage

00:51:58.040 --> 00:51:59.800
this is reflected in the decline

00:51:59.800 --> 00:52:02.200
of fertility rates and reduces

00:52:02.200 --> 00:52:03.640
the percentage of young people

00:52:03.640 --> 00:52:05.120
as I mentioned before

00:52:05.400 --> 00:52:07.440
that decreased from 49%

00:52:07.440 --> 00:52:09.400
I mean, the percentage of young people

00:52:09.400 --> 00:52:11.720
who are under 15 years of age

00:52:12.080 --> 00:52:16.600
to 30% or less, for example

00:52:16.880 --> 00:52:22.960
this decrease reduces dependency ratio

00:52:22.960 --> 00:52:24.960
dependency of youths

00:52:24.960 --> 00:52:26.520
so, the dependency ratio become

00:52:26.520 --> 00:52:28.600
decreased and elderlies

00:52:28.600 --> 00:52:30.520
dependency ratio is decreased for sure

00:52:30.520 --> 00:52:32.360
because we have only 4%

00:52:32.360 --> 00:52:34.960
of population are elderly people

00:52:34.960 --> 00:52:37.360
So, we have a dependency choice

00:52:37.640 --> 00:52:39.760
You mean the most of population

00:52:39.760 --> 00:52:40.640
are workforce

00:52:40.640 --> 00:52:45.607
It's an opportunity to save

00:52:46.080 --> 00:52:48.080
and this will impact the economy

00:52:48.080 --> 00:52:50.920
You also have a strong supply of workforce

00:52:51.400 --> 00:52:54.240
If we look at ratio and proportion

00:52:54.480 --> 00:52:55.560
we see a big percentage

00:52:55.560 --> 00:52:56.760
in the working age

00:52:57.080 --> 00:52:58.040
so, you have an opportunity,

00:52:58.280 --> 00:52:59.720
which is a supply of workforce

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:01.200
You also have an opportunity

00:53:01.200 --> 00:53:03.720
to grow the human capital

00:53:03.720 --> 00:53:05.240
You can save

00:53:05.480 --> 00:53:07.480
because young people are few

00:53:08.240 --> 00:53:10.520
So, you can invest in them

00:53:10.520 --> 00:53:12.720
in health, education and so on

00:53:15.000 --> 00:53:17.960
The result of saving is investment

00:53:18.400 --> 00:53:21.360
which is reflected in the financial return

00:53:21.360 --> 00:53:23.160
The demographic window

00:53:23.160 --> 00:53:28.160
continue for 2 or 3 decades

00:53:28.160 --> 00:53:32.120
then, the pyramid will inverted

00:53:32.680 --> 00:53:34.840
The proportion of elderlies is increasing

00:53:35.040 --> 00:53:39.120
so, the workforce will be fewer

00:53:40.120 --> 00:53:42.800
thus, we have to benefit

00:53:42.800 --> 00:53:44.320
from this demographic opportunity

00:53:44.640 --> 00:53:47.080
through investment in youths

00:53:49.320 --> 00:53:51.280
increasing their productivity in the society

00:53:52.640 --> 00:53:55.360
preparing them also for the future

00:53:55.360 --> 00:54:00.040
or develop policies that fit our needs

00:54:00.120 --> 00:54:01.720
Do you remember an international

00:54:01.720 --> 00:54:04.040
models that invested well in

00:54:04.040 --> 00:54:06.040
the demographic window

00:54:06.040 --> 00:54:09.320
and vice versa?

00:54:09.320 --> 00:54:10.720
 Nothing comes to me now

00:54:13.560 --> 00:54:17.240
one of the things that always

00:54:17.240 --> 00:54:20.250
related to the demographic window

00:54:20.250 --> 00:54:23.840
is the Arabic Fall

00:54:24.000 --> 00:54:26.280
It is a result of youth increasing

00:54:26.280 --> 00:54:28.960
and their lack of responsibility

00:54:28.960 --> 00:54:30.960
or they don't

00:54:30.960 --> 00:54:31.920
lose anything

00:54:31.920 --> 00:54:32.960
If you don't provide them

00:54:32.960 --> 00:54:37.320
 work and programms

00:54:37.320 --> 00:54:40.600
So, sometimes they cause

00:54:40.600 --> 00:54:42.440
riots and disturbances

00:54:42.440 --> 00:54:43.720
as what happened in some countries

00:54:44.120 --> 00:54:46.480
We can say this is a model

00:54:46.480 --> 00:54:48.880
of wasting resources

00:54:48.880 --> 00:54:50.880
Countries that benefit from it

00:54:50.880 --> 00:54:51.680
are Gulf Countries in my opinion

00:54:51.680 --> 00:54:54.360
due to their high potential

00:54:54.360 --> 00:54:56.360
They invest,

00:54:56.840 --> 00:54:58.600
provide programs,

00:54:58.600 --> 00:55:00.720
absorbed them into the labor market

00:55:00.720 --> 00:55:02.120
significantly

00:55:03.000 --> 00:55:07.400
It avoids the issue of demographic window

00:55:07.400 --> 00:55:08.440
and still the efforts

00:55:08.440 --> 00:55:10.040
of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia

00:55:10.040 --> 00:55:10.920
and some Gulf Countries

00:55:11.240 --> 00:55:13.800
to utilize this with the programs

00:55:13.800 --> 00:55:17.400
that I mentioned – recruitment programs

00:55:17.400 --> 00:55:18.960
training and development programs

00:55:18.960 --> 00:55:20.320
Mash 'Allah

00:55:20.320 --> 00:55:23.480
programs that motivate the youths

00:55:23.480 --> 00:55:26.160
programs to motivate the youths

00:55:26.160 --> 00:55:28.160
to start projects and support them

00:55:28.160 --> 00:55:28.660
Hadaf program

00:55:29.040 --> 00:55:30.800
they have many programs

00:55:30.800 --> 00:55:34.120
to qualify and motivate youths

00:55:34.120 --> 00:55:37.680
to develop their skills and gain professional certificates

00:55:37.680 --> 00:55:40.280
  There are many programs

00:55:40.280 --> 00:55:41.520
and I think some youths

00:55:41.520 --> 00:55:43.440
do not know these programs

00:55:43.440 --> 00:55:45.600
or there is a shortage

00:55:45.600 --> 00:55:47.600
in announcing them to youths

00:55:47.600 --> 00:55:53.680
Otherwise, the Vision has various programs

00:55:54.080 --> 00:55:56.480
The Vision came as a conquer

00:55:56.480 --> 00:55:58.040
 for the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia

00:55:58.040 --> 00:55:59.160
at this time

00:56:01.280 --> 00:56:02.760
Imagine that we did not do

00:56:02.760 --> 00:56:04.040
anything till now…

00:56:04.280 --> 00:56:08.400
It will be a catastrophic

00:56:08.640 --> 00:56:13.840
 for diversifying sources of income

00:56:14.680 --> 00:56:17.000
for developing youths

00:56:17.000 --> 00:56:18.000
and qualifying them

00:56:18.000 --> 00:56:18.800
for future professions,

00:56:19.400 --> 00:56:22.480
improve quality of life, sports…

00:56:22.480 --> 00:56:24.480
wonderful things

00:56:24.480 --> 00:56:27.640
in the Vision that left fingerprints

00:56:27.640 --> 00:56:30.000
and will still do in the future

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:31.400
I believe it is a conquer

00:56:31.400 --> 00:56:32.800
and positive side

00:56:33.240 --> 00:56:35.200
Whoever does not like

00:56:35.200 --> 00:56:37.080
the Vision to a certain degree

00:56:37.320 --> 00:56:42.280
applies to him the saying

00:56:42.960 --> 00:56:45.000
(Man is an enemy of anything he doesn't  know)

00:56:45.200 --> 00:56:48.280
because he doesn't know the Vision goals,

00:56:48.280 --> 00:56:49.760
doesn't know its programs,

00:56:49.760 --> 00:56:50.400
he doesn't know

00:56:50.400 --> 00:56:51.400
but yet talks about it

00:56:51.640 --> 00:56:53.680
It is really wonderful

00:56:53.680 --> 00:56:54.880
as I read more its documents;

00:56:54.880 --> 00:56:56.200
the more I admire it,

00:56:56.200 --> 00:56:57.960
admire who stands behind it,

00:56:57.960 --> 00:57:05.560
admire the strong and brave decision

00:57:05.760 --> 00:57:08.400
that was taken without hesitation

00:57:08.840 --> 00:57:10.280
in the right time

00:57:10.280 --> 00:57:11.680
The Vision, if you see,

00:57:11.680 --> 00:57:13.920
is covering the economy,

00:57:14.200 --> 00:57:15.240
empowering woman,

00:57:15.240 --> 00:57:17.720
developing workforce in general,

00:57:18.000 --> 00:57:21.360
 the environment; Green Riyadh,

00:57:21.360 --> 00:57:26.120
Green Saudi and  environment police

00:57:26.880 --> 00:57:27.640
It is massive

00:57:27.640 --> 00:57:29.440
Also, decrease resources consumption

00:57:29.680 --> 00:57:31.800
We are left with certain issues

00:57:32.720 --> 00:57:33.560
Water…

00:57:33.800 --> 00:57:37.640
and this leads us to sustainability

00:57:37.640 --> 00:57:39.640
I think the issue of water

00:57:39.640 --> 00:57:41.120
needs more efforts

00:57:41.720 --> 00:57:43.800
to develop water resources

00:57:44.240 --> 00:57:46.440
maybe by developing technologies

00:57:46.840 --> 00:57:48.000
for seawater desalination

00:57:48.000 --> 00:57:50.520
using solar energy which is available

00:57:50.520 --> 00:57:51.400
Of course,

00:57:51.400 --> 00:57:56.360
we have rationing water use

00:57:56.600 --> 00:58:01.840
We have to put more effort

00:58:01.840 --> 00:58:04.160
in developing water resources

00:58:04.160 --> 00:58:07.880
because it is the live nerve

00:58:07.880 --> 00:58:08.920
in sustainability

00:58:10.600 --> 00:58:12.560
There are many questions

00:58:15.000 --> 00:58:16.400
or let me leave them to the end

00:58:16.400 --> 00:58:17.040
I will try to conclude

00:58:17.040 --> 00:58:21.240
 with 2 questions

00:58:21.840 --> 00:58:23.400
related to the non-Saudi residents

00:58:24.040 --> 00:58:25.040
percentage vs Saudi citizens

00:58:26.080 --> 00:58:27.800
in the demographics

00:58:27.800 --> 00:58:28.520
Today we have

00:58:28.520 --> 00:58:32.120
38% non-Saudis

00:58:32.120 --> 00:58:33.880
of the total population of Saudi

00:58:34.160 --> 00:58:35.400
Crown Prince in his interview

00:58:35.400 --> 00:58:40.240
in Ramadan two years ago,

00:58:40.520 --> 00:58:44.160
he predicted (not targeted)

00:58:44.160 --> 00:58:47.400
 by 20230 or 2040

00:58:47.400 --> 00:58:49.080
to have 50% non-Saudis

00:58:50.480 --> 00:58:51.400
What is the impact

00:58:51.400 --> 00:58:54.760
of having this large number

00:58:54.760 --> 00:58:58.560
of cultures within the Saudi society?

00:58:59.280 --> 00:59:01.520
Everything has positive impact

00:59:01.520 --> 00:59:02.040
and negative impact

00:59:02.040 --> 00:59:02.800
What is the positive

00:59:02.800 --> 00:59:03.320
 and what is the negative?

00:59:03.560 --> 00:59:06.040
The positive… openness to the world

00:59:06.040 --> 00:59:08.920
and Cross-Cultural Couples

00:59:08.920 --> 00:59:11.440
 The human cannot live in isolation

00:59:12.040 --> 00:59:16.040
So, if we have skills, experiences,
and values

00:59:16.400 --> 00:59:18.320
there are values, experiences,

00:59:18.320 --> 00:59:20.400
and skills that we need

00:59:20.400 --> 00:59:22.040
and we have to interact

00:59:22.960 --> 00:59:26.760
with them to empower our development

00:59:27.000 --> 00:59:28.440
empower our existence

00:59:28.440 --> 00:59:30.760
The world becomes a small village

00:59:31.240 --> 00:59:33.240
You cannot live in isolation

00:59:33.240 --> 00:59:39.400
and for sure we need each other

00:59:39.600 --> 00:59:41.560
This is the positive side,

00:59:41.560 --> 00:59:42.680
 what is the negative one?

00:59:42.680 --> 00:59:44.160
 Nobody with basic sense

00:59:44.160 --> 00:59:47.480
 says that we don't need non-Saudis

00:59:47.720 --> 00:59:48.600
 It's impossible

00:59:49.400 --> 00:59:49.880
Even in the US,

00:59:49.880 --> 00:59:51.120
 What is the percentage in the US,

00:59:51.720 --> 00:59:54.200
 in France.. all countries

00:59:54.200 --> 00:59:55.240
This is the positive side,

00:59:55.240 --> 00:59:56.499
what is the negative side?

00:59:56.499 --> 00:59:57.600
The negative side

00:59:58.080 --> 00:59:59.920
is about the identity,

01:00:00.280 --> 01:00:02.240
the national identity,

01:00:02.480 --> 01:00:04.237
because it will affect the language,

01:00:04.237 --> 01:00:11.120
the identity, the Saudi identity in general.

01:00:11.600 --> 01:00:15.840
It affects, if it is not regulated correctly

01:00:16.320 --> 01:00:20.800
 It might even affect the stability

01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:21.520
 I mean,

01:00:21.520 --> 01:00:24.880
if the ratio increased exponentially,

01:00:25.240 --> 01:00:27.680
it might affect the stability

01:00:27.680 --> 01:00:30.000
They demand certain rights,

01:00:30.360 --> 01:00:33.200
they might demand adopting

01:00:33.200 --> 01:00:34.080
certain trends

01:00:34.080 --> 01:00:35.280
that might not be suitable

01:00:35.280 --> 01:00:36.040
 to the society

01:00:36.480 --> 01:00:38.040
maybe their behaviors

01:00:38.720 --> 01:00:41.440
 has a certain degree of openness

01:00:41.440 --> 01:00:43.040
that might not be acceptable

01:00:43.040 --> 01:00:43.920
to society

01:00:45.280 --> 01:00:48.840
 Behaviors that contradict our values

01:00:51.080 --> 01:00:53.520
Maybe some economic aspects

01:00:53.520 --> 01:00:58.160
they control some economic sectors

01:00:58.160 --> 01:00:59.440
some professions,

01:00:59.560 --> 01:01:03.320
if the citizens are not empowered

01:01:03.880 --> 01:01:04.960
But, I think,

01:01:05.320 --> 01:01:12.438
the Vision has certain programs
that deals with these big challenges

01:01:12.438 --> 01:01:16.560
But, it should be looked at

01:01:17.120 --> 01:01:19.560
with high attention and care

01:01:19.560 --> 01:01:23.120
 because definitely, it will have an impact

01:01:23.120 --> 01:01:24.440
positive and negative

01:01:24.440 --> 01:01:27.120
we have to evaluate this situation

01:01:27.120 --> 01:01:30.520
 But, the Vision and its ambitious objectives

01:01:31.640 --> 01:01:34.280
will not be realized using

01:01:34.280 --> 01:01:37.440
only the local workforce

01:01:37.440 --> 01:01:41.160
 because there are new fields

01:01:41.160 --> 01:01:41.600
to the Saudi society,

01:01:41.600 --> 01:01:44.800
 you have to attract high skills

01:01:47.200 --> 01:01:50.080
Also, tourism

01:01:50.080 --> 01:01:53.120
people from all over the world

01:01:53.120 --> 01:01:53.620
will come to the society

01:01:54.680 --> 01:01:56.880
You have to adopt this change,

01:01:57.280 --> 01:01:58.880
and you have to protect

01:01:59.160 --> 01:02:01.360
your society and kids

01:02:01.360 --> 01:02:04.200
 using just what we discussed

01:02:04.200 --> 01:02:07.840
to enhance the authentic Arabic values

01:02:08.240 --> 01:02:12.080
our organizations, even private,

01:02:12.680 --> 01:02:14.400
 should have a certain direction

01:02:14.400 --> 01:02:16.360
of course optional

01:02:16.360 --> 01:02:17.880
as the government cannot force them

01:02:18.080 --> 01:02:20.040
but it should come from the national bond

01:02:20.480 --> 01:02:22.040
and the nationalist sense

01:02:22.040 --> 01:02:26.600
 the social responsibility towards this country

01:02:26.960 --> 01:02:28.440
they should have contribution

01:02:28.880 --> 01:02:31.720
(from social responsibility perspective)

01:02:32.200 --> 01:02:35.560
in strengthening national belonging,

01:02:35.560 --> 01:02:39.080
supporting the national identity

01:02:39.080 --> 01:02:44.160
supporting events taking this orientation

01:02:44.480 --> 01:02:46.960
There are big challenges

01:02:47.520 --> 01:02:49.560
 but we cannot live without challenges

01:02:49.560 --> 01:02:52.840
 We should have challenges to overcome

01:02:53.120 --> 01:02:54.560
 and I am sure

01:02:54.560 --> 01:02:56.560
that we are capable in this country

01:02:56.560 --> 01:03:00.360
with what we have of professionals

01:03:00.360 --> 01:03:02.400
The last point I will tackle from the points

01:03:02.400 --> 01:03:04.200
that has a social impact;

01:03:05.120 --> 01:03:06.800
 then I will move on to questions

01:03:06.800 --> 01:03:07.840
from friends is about the internal immigration

01:03:07.840 --> 01:03:08.320
 (migration)

01:03:08.320 --> 01:03:09.680
You preside a study specialized

01:03:10.200 --> 01:03:12.360
on internal immigration

01:03:12.360 --> 01:03:13.338
There are a lot of talks nowadays

01:03:13.338 --> 01:03:16.240
about migration of most inhabitance including the big cities

01:03:16.240 --> 01:03:17.600
of the kingdom cities to Riyadh;

01:03:19.280 --> 01:03:20.680
like Jeddah and AlKhobar

01:03:20.680 --> 01:03:22.400
most of them are moving

01:03:22.400 --> 01:03:24.680
to live in Riyadh

01:03:24.680 --> 01:03:27.240
How do you see such incident

01:03:28.680 --> 01:03:30.960
and what it's positive

01:03:30.960 --> 01:03:33.400
and negative impact in the long run?

01:03:34.280 --> 01:03:34.857
First of all,

01:03:34.857 --> 01:03:36.320
Migration is a strange phenomenon

01:03:37.280 --> 01:03:39.120
Migration is a positive phenomenon

01:03:39.120 --> 01:03:39.960
Positive!

01:03:40.160 --> 01:03:43.240
 Positive, and it has negativieties

01:03:43.240 --> 01:03:44.760
They might not agree with you,

01:03:44.760 --> 01:03:45.800
 but explain to us!

01:03:45.800 --> 01:03:47.200
On the positive side, first,

01:03:47.920 --> 01:03:49.160
from a national perspective,

01:03:49.480 --> 01:03:52.840
it contributes in coalition,

01:03:53.440 --> 01:03:56.280
it contributes in national bonding

01:03:56.880 --> 01:03:58.280
inhabitance from the south

01:03:58.280 --> 01:04:01.040
comes to the middle and goes to the east

01:04:01.040 --> 01:04:03.040
 Inhabitance from the east

01:04:03.040 --> 01:04:03.540
comes to the west

01:04:05.480 --> 01:04:07.880
There is a population infusion

01:04:08.127 --> 01:04:11.400
and this has a great impact

01:04:11.400 --> 01:04:14.787
that shapes out the Saudi entity,

01:04:14.787 --> 01:04:16.121
immigration –

01:04:16.560 --> 01:04:18.543
may be we do not think about it

01:04:18.543 --> 01:04:22.035
but it caused changes in the society

01:04:22.035 --> 01:04:27.040
coalition, converge even in clothing, dialect, language,

01:04:27.040 --> 01:04:28.640
 habits and in traditions

01:04:28.920 --> 01:04:31.560
we know the Southern dialect,

01:04:31.560 --> 01:04:33.120
 the northern dialect

01:04:33.360 --> 01:04:35.160
They understand our dialect

01:04:35.920 --> 01:04:36.840
Even the dialect itself

01:04:36.840 --> 01:04:38.720
 is reformed and changed.

01:04:38.720 --> 01:04:40.720
The White dialect now

01:04:40.960 --> 01:04:41.600
Because of the immigration

01:04:42.080 --> 01:04:44.480
 This is the social and national aspect

01:04:46.600 --> 01:04:52.560
Migration is an economic balancing factor

01:04:52.560 --> 01:04:54.000
How it does that?

01:04:54.400 --> 01:04:59.520
By reducing unemployment from one side

01:05:01.320 --> 01:05:01.820
 and increase employment on other side

01:05:02.320 --> 01:05:08.440
It increases the income,

01:05:08.680 --> 01:05:10.400
it causes a kind of balance

01:05:10.400 --> 01:05:15.880
or reduce the regional gap between regions

01:05:16.160 --> 01:05:18.240
because excess workers out there

01:05:18.240 --> 01:05:20.280
 come here causing the reduction

01:05:20.280 --> 01:05:25.200
supply and demand – of income here;

01:05:25.200 --> 01:05:26.080
and increase it there

01:05:26.080 --> 01:05:28.600
because supply of workforce decreased

01:05:28.600 --> 01:05:30.360
So, it causes a balance

01:05:30.360 --> 01:05:30.840
and reduces the gap

01:05:30.840 --> 01:05:37.200
between directorates

01:05:37.480 --> 01:05:41.320
and it played that role effectively.

01:05:41.640 --> 01:05:44.160
The problem… the cons…

01:05:44.160 --> 01:05:46.160
People tend to have certain imagination,

01:05:46.160 --> 01:05:48.040
there is a theory called City Lights

01:05:48.240 --> 01:05:53.240
People are attracted to them

01:05:53.240 --> 01:05:55.200
This theory was applied in Africa

01:05:55.200 --> 01:05:57.760
they used to see the city lights

01:05:57.760 --> 01:05:59.040
and dazzled with them,

01:05:59.040 --> 01:06:00.360
then they go the city

01:06:01.400 --> 01:06:03.600
The problem is that some people

01:06:03.840 --> 01:06:05.160
come to the city thinking

01:06:05.160 --> 01:06:08.880
that work is available to anybody in the city

01:06:08.880 --> 01:06:10.240
then they start coming with skill sets
 

01:06:10.240 --> 01:06:13.440
 that are not needed in the market

01:06:13.720 --> 01:06:15.440
They come and cannot afford housing,

01:06:16.000 --> 01:06:18.560
cannot find a job,

01:06:18.880 --> 01:06:20.880
and there is no social solidary

01:06:20.880 --> 01:06:21.400
(like in the past) where he comes

01:06:21.400 --> 01:06:24.840
and stay with you till he finds a job

01:06:25.120 --> 01:06:30.360
then Shantytowns arises

01:06:30.880 --> 01:06:31.720
(which was combat here) around cities

01:06:31.720 --> 01:06:34.880
living in old districts arises

01:06:34.880 --> 01:06:37.840
 and now old districts are reviewed

01:06:37.840 --> 01:06:39.840
and getting red of them started

01:06:39.840 --> 01:06:41.560
because they start being focal points

01:06:41.560 --> 01:06:44.440
attracting new migrants

01:06:44.440 --> 01:06:45.760
 internal from the kingdom

01:06:45.760 --> 01:06:47.040
our externals from outside.

01:06:47.400 --> 01:06:50.040
And absence of work causes unemployment,

01:06:50.040 --> 01:06:56.080
drugs, mendicity,

01:06:56.320 --> 01:06:59.920
and even non-ethical behaviors,

01:06:59.920 --> 01:07:04.760
and security issues

01:07:05.000 --> 01:07:07.320
citizens’ security (not national security)

01:07:07.320 --> 01:07:10.080
theft increases, crimes,

01:07:10.080 --> 01:07:12.280
 house breakouts, cars’ stealing

01:07:13.080 --> 01:07:17.120
These are the cons of migration

01:07:17.400 --> 01:07:20.520
when it is at a rate higher

01:07:20.520 --> 01:07:23.120
than the city capacity

01:07:23.120 --> 01:07:26.800
And today; does Riyadh receive migrants

01:07:26.800 --> 01:07:28.200
at normal rates or above the normal?

01:07:29.120 --> 01:07:32.840
Previously, the yearly population growth

01:07:32.840 --> 01:07:38.600
was 8%, and this is a very high rate

01:07:38.880 --> 01:07:41.880
This causes even traffic jam,

01:07:41.880 --> 01:07:45.240
 prices increase for housing and so on

01:07:46.480 --> 01:07:48.600
 Then, there was a direction

01:07:48.600 --> 01:07:51.320
from the government to grow Provinces

01:07:51.320 --> 01:07:53.280
Universities are open in Governorates

01:07:53.280 --> 01:07:57.480
They open universities in all Provinces

01:07:57.480 --> 01:07:58.840
 This reduces the migration?

01:07:58.920 --> 01:08:00.000
Reduce it to certain limit

01:08:00.480 --> 01:08:04.160
Also, Economic Cities (Wa’ad Al Shamal,

01:08:04.520 --> 01:08:08.840
Prince Abdul Aziz bin Musa'ed City in Hail,

01:08:08.840 --> 01:08:11.520
Jazan Economic City

01:08:11.520 --> 01:08:13.320
for basic industries,

01:08:13.480 --> 01:08:18.760
King Abdullah Economic City (I think in Rabigh)

01:08:19.960 --> 01:08:22.520
all this, and the government direction

01:08:23.200 --> 01:08:23.840
was to develop

01:08:23.840 --> 01:08:25.480
even King Abdullah – may Allah bless his sole

01:08:25.480 --> 01:08:27.200
 when he visited Jazan

01:08:27.480 --> 01:08:32.080
and try to apologize to certain degree

01:08:34.400 --> 01:08:38.000
All this… and even development plans,

01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:38.360
in the past,

01:08:38.360 --> 01:08:38.880
were encouraging this

01:08:38.880 --> 01:08:41.800
but with our real empowerment

01:08:41.800 --> 01:08:42.760
 They were encouraging

01:08:42.760 --> 01:08:45.240
the balanced regional development.

01:08:45.720 --> 01:08:46.800
Now after the Vision,

01:08:47.160 --> 01:08:48.880
what happen to the migration to Riyadh?

01:08:48.880 --> 01:08:49.920
After the vision things are changed

01:08:49.920 --> 01:08:55.200
The vision is targeting to develop cities,

01:08:55.200 --> 01:08:55.680
 this includes the development

01:08:55.680 --> 01:09:00.880
of three Saudi cities to be

01:09:00.880 --> 01:09:02.160
top 100 cities in the world

01:09:02.160 --> 01:09:04.440
among the top 100 cities in the world

01:09:05.520 --> 01:09:07.560
This direction involves enhancements

01:09:07.920 --> 01:09:12.360
 in the infrastructure and environment

01:09:12.800 --> 01:09:15.280
enhancement of the entertainment fields,

01:09:15.280 --> 01:09:18.000
enhancement in the quality of living

01:09:18.000 --> 01:09:18.880
 in the city

01:09:18.880 --> 01:09:20.440
And honestly,

01:09:20.440 --> 01:09:23.720
in this Riyadh city is very lucky

01:09:23.960 --> 01:09:25.040
 sports tracks,

01:09:26.000 --> 01:09:29.560
afforestation for all its roads and streets,

01:09:29.560 --> 01:09:31.760
improving infrastructure,

01:09:32.240 --> 01:09:34.080
transforming it to smart city

01:09:34.080 --> 01:09:35.960
There are huge efforts,

01:09:36.200 --> 01:09:38.440
like Neom and the Line

01:09:38.800 --> 01:09:41.960
– the smart city to be build

01:09:42.480 --> 01:09:46.160
to transform Saudi cities

01:09:46.160 --> 01:09:48.840
(Especially, Riyadh, Dammam, and Jeddah)

01:09:49.720 --> 01:09:51.080
to the smart cities

01:09:51.360 --> 01:09:53.120
Cities that use technology

01:09:53.120 --> 01:09:55.040
and reduce (on the citizen)

01:09:55.040 --> 01:09:58.840
 the troubles of transportation,

01:09:58.840 --> 01:10:00.840
going through traffic jams, pollution

01:10:01.080 --> 01:10:02.320
reduce pollution….

01:10:02.800 --> 01:10:05.600
So, there are huge efforts

01:10:05.600 --> 01:10:09.040
to transform Riyadh to smart city

01:10:09.040 --> 01:10:10.760
by using Artificial Intelligence,

01:10:13.320 --> 01:10:15.000
technology, afforestation, sports tracks for public

01:10:16.160 --> 01:10:17.320
However, at the same time,

01:10:17.800 --> 01:10:19.720
the plan is to have big numbers

01:10:19.720 --> 01:10:20.920
of comers to Riyadh

01:10:21.320 --> 01:10:23.640
I hope the big number of come

01:10:23.640 --> 01:10:26.560
 in stages so the city can accommodate them

01:10:27.720 --> 01:10:29.760
Also, there should be development

01:10:29.760 --> 01:10:31.680
of the areas around Riyadh city

01:10:32.200 --> 01:10:34.240
 For example, Huraymila,

01:10:34.240 --> 01:10:36.360
Amaaria, Al-Muzahmiya

01:10:36.360 --> 01:10:39.320
Howtat.. Howtat Bani Tammim… of course

01:10:39.320 --> 01:10:40.400
Howtat Bani Tammim for sure…

01:10:40.400 --> 01:10:42.520
 should have some changes

01:10:42.520 --> 01:10:43.880
and I hope that it will have an airport soon

01:10:43.880 --> 01:10:45.920
Airport…

01:10:45.920 --> 01:10:48.320
So, you can come to us by plane

01:10:48.320 --> 01:10:51.280
By plane.. or you leave the jam here

01:10:51.280 --> 01:10:53.360
 We move to live there

01:10:53.360 --> 01:10:58.040
and come there by plane, car, or train.

01:10:58.040 --> 01:11:00.880
So, there are heart-warming wonderful efforts

01:11:00.880 --> 01:11:02.920
for Riyadh city

01:11:02.920 --> 01:11:08.160
However, the worry is when huge numbers

01:11:08.160 --> 01:11:10.560
move to Riyadh; what will happen!

01:11:12.560 --> 01:11:14.200
This is not the worry for a lot of people,

01:11:14.200 --> 01:11:16.200
especially coming from outside Riyadh

01:11:16.200 --> 01:11:18.720
Their worry if I want a city

01:11:18.720 --> 01:11:20.600
 with all these facilities,

01:11:20.600 --> 01:11:22.400
do I need to move from my village

01:11:22.400 --> 01:11:23.920
 or town to Riyadh?

01:11:23.920 --> 01:11:27.520
 I need these facilities in my own town

01:11:27.520 --> 01:11:28.020
where I am living

01:11:28.360 --> 01:11:32.440
Distribution of the mega project,

01:11:32.440 --> 01:11:33.000
this is an opinion;

01:11:33.000 --> 01:11:34.120
that the mega projects should be distributed

01:11:34.400 --> 01:11:36.880
Another opinion think that distribution

01:11:36.880 --> 01:11:38.280
 of these projects will eliminate

01:11:38.280 --> 01:11:39.480
the economic impact

01:11:39.480 --> 01:11:40.880
 If you put them in one place,

01:11:40.880 --> 01:11:43.320
you create a city like London, Paris..

01:11:43.320 --> 01:11:49.760
What I forget is that generating jobs

01:11:49.760 --> 01:11:53.160
 in cities with good infrastructure as Riyadh

01:11:53.160 --> 01:11:55.560
is easier and less expensive

01:11:55.560 --> 01:11:58.560
than generating job in small cities

01:11:58.840 --> 01:12:00.000
And this might be the perspective

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:05.120
of the Vision of focusing on limited cities

01:12:05.520 --> 01:12:06.120
because they are the ones

01:12:06.120 --> 01:12:09.080
to create jobs, to move the economy

01:12:09.720 --> 01:12:13.720
How much is the local production

01:12:13.720 --> 01:12:15.360
of Riyadh to the economy?

01:12:15.720 --> 01:12:17.720
Although we do not have accurate statistics,

01:12:17.720 --> 01:12:19.560
but we do not need statistics

01:12:19.560 --> 01:12:23.240
 to know that it is primary

01:12:23.400 --> 01:12:25.090
in generating many jobs

01:12:25.090 --> 01:12:28.600
and it is main contributor into local production

01:12:30.240 --> 01:12:32.440
However, I do not think that the Vision

01:12:32.440 --> 01:12:35.840
ignore the small cities and towns,

01:12:35.840 --> 01:12:40.640
but it aims to empower the economy

01:12:40.640 --> 01:12:44.160
and increase the degree of competitiveness

01:12:44.160 --> 01:12:45.840
for Saudi economy

01:12:45.840 --> 01:12:49.080
Because of you will develop all cities

01:12:49.080 --> 01:12:51.080
with the same level and efforts,

01:12:51.080 --> 01:12:53.040
 it will take long time

01:12:53.720 --> 01:12:56.280
and you cannot build an economy

01:12:56.280 --> 01:12:58.120
 with high degree of competitiveness globally

01:13:00.360 --> 01:13:02.520
I'll take a set of questions and comments,
and I want your brief comments

01:13:02.520 --> 01:13:03.240
  Abu Muhammed,

01:13:04.800 --> 01:13:06.520
in order to gain time

01:13:08.160 --> 01:13:09.200
Somebody is stating

01:13:09.560 --> 01:13:10.440
 that financial loss resulting

01:13:10.440 --> 01:13:11.006
from divorce is estimated

01:13:11.006 --> 01:13:13.080
at SR 3.5 billion in Saudi,

01:13:15.320 --> 01:13:15.920
 What are the reasons?

01:13:15.920 --> 01:13:17.920
You have an article in Sep 2021

01:13:17.920 --> 01:13:18.698
 about divorce reasons,

01:13:19.440 --> 01:13:20.160
you summarized them in;

01:13:20.160 --> 01:13:21.880
1- increased complexity,

01:13:22.360 --> 01:13:23.920
2- rising costs,

01:13:24.680 --> 01:13:25.520
3- increased disputes

01:13:25.520 --> 01:13:27.480
The first three are clear,

01:13:28.000 --> 01:13:30.000
 but then you said conflicting goals

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:30.760
and priorities;

01:13:31.328 --> 01:13:32.880
and you said cultural differences.

01:13:33.280 --> 01:13:36.320
 Can you briefly explain these two?

01:13:37.280 --> 01:13:40.760
Cultural differences means the way to choose the wife,

01:13:41.240 --> 01:13:43.720
 traditional style, I think,

01:13:44.000 --> 01:13:45.480
needs fine-tuning.

01:13:45.960 --> 01:13:50.320
It needs a degree of openness

01:13:50.720 --> 01:13:52.920
in how to meet the wife

01:13:52.920 --> 01:13:54.920
there is a big issue,

01:13:54.920 --> 01:13:56.280
especially in cities…

01:13:56.600 --> 01:13:58.720
somebody comes from Hafar Albatin,

01:13:58.720 --> 01:14:00.920
 Howtat (as you mentioned),

01:14:00.920 --> 01:14:02.640
or Rughabah

01:14:02.760 --> 01:14:05.680
Do not forget Rughabah please

01:14:06.320 --> 01:14:07.360
This person comes here

01:14:07.680 --> 01:14:10.080
and he has daughters…

01:14:10.080 --> 01:14:12.280
 nobody knows that he has daughters

01:14:12.280 --> 01:14:13.520
It is difficult to offer your daughters

01:14:13.520 --> 01:14:22.280
for marriage… here is the problem
…. Issue in the marriage..

01:14:22.520 --> 01:14:23.600
Some times, because what is offered

01:14:23.600 --> 01:14:24.248
to the women is few from men

01:14:24.248 --> 01:14:27.080
 who want to marry..

01:14:27.320 --> 01:14:30.560
 So, she might accept to marry a man

01:14:30.560 --> 01:14:33.040
 who does not fit her educationally

01:14:33.040 --> 01:14:34.360
or culturally.

01:14:34.880 --> 01:14:37.320
This might result in divorce.

01:14:37.560 --> 01:14:38.440
This is cultural differences,

01:14:38.440 --> 01:14:40.040
what about conflicting goals and priorities?

01:14:41.000 --> 01:14:43.960
How this causes the divorce?

01:14:44.720 --> 01:14:47.440
Conflicting priorities…

01:14:47.440 --> 01:14:48.720
maybe the man has a priority

01:14:48.720 --> 01:14:50.680
 to have kids

01:14:51.640 --> 01:14:56.240
but her priority might be to work

01:14:56.240 --> 01:15:06.720
Also, it might be the degree of openness

01:15:06.720 --> 01:15:09.960
 Some husbands might not want

01:15:09.960 --> 01:15:14.120
 his wife to visit her friends

01:15:14.120 --> 01:15:18.960
or go to a coffee shop with her friends

01:15:19.280 --> 01:15:20.840
On the other hand,

01:15:20.840 --> 01:15:22.800
some husbands accept this

01:15:23.360 --> 01:15:24.800
So, the differences in accepting

01:15:24.800 --> 01:15:28.720
 these priorities and concepts caused divorce.

01:15:29.040 --> 01:15:35.640
 Here is Khalid Al AlSaheikh saying

01:15:35.640 --> 01:15:36.440
that Saudi is approaching

01:15:36.440 --> 01:15:37.080
 the minimum fertility rate

01:15:37.080 --> 01:15:39.560
with 2.1 per woman

01:15:39.560 --> 01:15:40.280
going below this rate

01:15:40.280 --> 01:15:42.160
will result in rapid decline

01:15:42.160 --> 01:15:43.655
in population numbers in future

01:15:43.655 --> 01:15:45.440
It might reach to a point

01:15:45.440 --> 01:15:46.573
where it is difficult to reverse its impact

01:15:47.680 --> 01:15:50.920
This rate assumes no immigrants to Saudi. etc

01:15:50.920 --> 01:15:52.907
 We discussed this point,

01:15:52.907 --> 01:15:54.040
but in simple terms

01:15:54.040 --> 01:15:55.928
Today, there's maternity leave,

01:15:55.928 --> 01:15:59.720
motherhood leave, hours for breastfeeding,

01:15:59.720 --> 01:16:04.560
family housing loan

01:16:04.560 --> 01:16:06.040
all these motivations exist

01:16:06.040 --> 01:16:07.760
and yet the birth rate is declining

01:16:07.760 --> 01:16:09.280
If you are asked about this?

01:16:09.560 --> 01:16:10.560
I want to say,

01:16:10.560 --> 01:16:12.360
that he is exaggerating a bit

01:16:12.600 --> 01:16:13.240
 The fast impact?

01:16:13.480 --> 01:16:15.000
fast and shrinkage

01:16:15.000 --> 01:16:16.160
It does not happen like this,

01:16:16.160 --> 01:16:18.720
it happen over long period of time

01:16:18.720 --> 01:16:23.360
Even if the rate is below 2,

01:16:23.560 --> 01:16:24.360
 the number of population

01:16:24.360 --> 01:16:25.160
will not shrink immediately

01:16:25.160 --> 01:16:26.672
it will take long time

01:16:26.672 --> 01:16:27.520
because there is something

01:16:27.520 --> 01:16:30.680
called momentum force

01:16:31.080 --> 01:16:34.840
 It needs a decade or two

01:16:34.840 --> 01:16:40.920
till the population start shrinking,
it is not fast happening.

01:16:40.920 --> 01:16:41.800
20 or 30 years not fast, but the question is

01:16:41.800 --> 01:16:42.300
that with all this motivations,

01:16:42.300 --> 01:16:44.440
why people do not reproductive.

01:16:45.000 --> 01:16:46.880
 If today you have the power

01:16:47.760 --> 01:16:51.760
of suggesting a law or order

01:16:51.760 --> 01:16:55.240
to improve this number,

01:16:55.240 --> 01:16:56.760
what will you say? One decision.

01:16:56.760 --> 01:16:58.880
First if it is one decision,

01:16:58.880 --> 01:17:03.120
I would say that very early marriage

01:17:03.120 --> 01:17:07.920
is not good as well as the late marriage

01:17:07.920 --> 01:17:09.000
Most of the young generation

01:17:09.000 --> 01:17:12.400
would like to build themselves

01:17:15.280 --> 01:17:17.680
to have a successful family life

01:17:17.680 --> 01:17:18.560
They do not want

01:17:18.560 --> 01:17:20.720
to go into a family life

01:17:20.720 --> 01:17:22.400
that ends into divorce

01:17:22.400 --> 01:17:27.360
This is what they think off.

01:17:31.320 --> 01:17:33.880
I am not in favor of pushing youths

01:17:33.880 --> 01:17:37.360
 to marry haphazardly

01:17:37.360 --> 01:17:39.600
Then they will divorce!.

01:17:39.600 --> 01:17:44.680
There should be prerequisites

01:17:44.680 --> 01:17:46.120
for this step (housing …)

01:17:46.120 --> 01:17:48.960
But this leads us to the importance

01:17:49.840 --> 01:17:50.920
 of cooperation between the couples,

01:17:50.920 --> 01:17:53.800
 because it seems that the whole load

01:17:54.200 --> 01:17:57.480
is on the husbands shoulder.

01:17:58.080 --> 01:18:00.320
I believe, life is a cooperation

01:18:01.040 --> 01:18:03.080
So, if the woman is working,

01:18:03.080 --> 01:18:06.640
then she should contribute…
This will ease the marriage,

01:18:06.920 --> 01:18:09.240
ease the reproductive

01:18:09.480 --> 01:18:11.360
Because the man feel the woman

01:18:11.360 --> 01:18:12.115
is his life partner,

01:18:12.115 --> 01:18:14.960
contribute in building the family

01:18:14.960 --> 01:18:16.960
 the cost of family

01:18:16.960 --> 01:18:19.960
… this will ease marriage,

01:18:19.960 --> 01:18:21.320
and will ease

01:18:21.320 --> 01:18:22.360
 to certain degree the reproductive

01:18:22.680 --> 01:18:26.600
So, if a decision is to be taken

01:18:26.600 --> 01:18:27.920
which is not a real decision,

01:18:27.920 --> 01:18:30.200
 but encouraging the woman to contribute

01:18:30.760 --> 01:18:34.520
because the personal status law

01:18:34.520 --> 01:18:38.240
(which was issued recently)

01:18:38.240 --> 01:18:39.880
is stating that alimony

01:18:40.520 --> 01:18:41.400
is the responsibility of the husband

01:18:41.400 --> 01:18:45.000
and it is based on Sharia

01:18:45.240 --> 01:18:45.986
and there is no contradiction of Sharia,

01:18:45.986 --> 01:18:55.440
but to build a strong Islamic society and a coherent family;

01:18:55.440 --> 01:18:58.000
maybe they can find a way

01:18:58.000 --> 01:19:00.000
for the woman to voluntarily do this

01:19:00.280 --> 01:19:00.780
and I do not think

01:19:00.780 --> 01:19:05.440
there is anything in Sharia stopping this

01:19:05.440 --> 01:19:09.200
And there is nothing prohibit

01:19:09.200 --> 01:19:11.480
putting a condition in the marriage contract
between both parties

01:19:11.480 --> 01:19:12.760
that the life will be based on contribution

01:19:15.560 --> 01:19:17.200
as far as they both agree

01:19:17.480 --> 01:19:20.760
I think this will support the family coherence,

01:19:20.760 --> 01:19:23.920
and ease the youth marriage.

01:19:24.200 --> 01:19:25.844
I would, also, point to

01:19:25.844 --> 01:19:31.280
 
the high cost of housing Despite the great efforts

01:19:31.280 --> 01:19:35.360
which was put by the ministry of housing

01:19:36.160 --> 01:19:37.880
(their programs enable

01:19:37.880 --> 01:19:39.840
many  youths and families

01:19:40.240 --> 01:19:41.840
to own their houses

01:19:42.160 --> 01:19:45.560
in Riyadh as well as outside Riyadh)

01:19:45.560 --> 01:19:50.920
Really their programs gave many options

01:19:51.200 --> 01:19:51.680
which was limited

01:19:51.680 --> 01:19:53.200
to the real estate development fund to public

01:19:53.640 --> 01:19:54.800
Despite all of this, the issue is

01:19:55.280 --> 01:20:00.920
 the high cost of lands and housing units

01:20:01.240 --> 01:20:04.480
 especially those who don't meet the criteria

01:20:04.480 --> 01:20:04.987
for Sakani program,

01:20:05.960 --> 01:20:13.880
or they want to prepare

01:20:13.880 --> 01:20:16.760
before going into marriage.

01:20:16.760 --> 01:20:19.840
A family counselor, Thamer AlSaleh,

01:20:20.440 --> 01:20:21.840
in an interview on Rotana said

01:20:22.320 --> 01:20:22.680
“female work does not have

01:20:22.680 --> 01:20:24.960
any benefit to the family welfare

01:20:25.280 --> 01:20:25.920
in addition to the issues

01:20:25.920 --> 01:20:27.560
of relationships formed

01:20:27.560 --> 01:20:28.240
in the work environment,

01:20:28.560 --> 01:20:29.504
and the negative spirit

01:20:29.504 --> 01:20:31.840
that the woman bring back home

01:20:31.840 --> 01:20:32.400
from workplace”

01:20:32.400 --> 01:20:34.865
Not in all cases.

01:20:34.865 --> 01:20:37.040
I imagine it is

01:20:38.160 --> 01:20:40.160
an agreement between both partners

01:20:40.560 --> 01:20:44.280
I think the lack of women work

01:20:44.600 --> 01:20:46.480
is weakening the woman

01:20:48.320 --> 01:20:52.280
and makes her accepts

01:20:53.120 --> 01:20:56.360
living in an unsuccessful marriage

01:20:56.720 --> 01:20:57.940
and this is an issue,

01:20:57.940 --> 01:20:58.960
human dignity is important

01:20:58.960 --> 01:21:04.040
especially, we have many stories

01:21:04.040 --> 01:21:07.080
of situations where the woman went through tough conditions

01:21:07.080 --> 01:21:12.040
 So, preventing woman from work

01:21:12.040 --> 01:21:14.360
might put her into critical situation.

01:21:14.360 --> 01:21:18.520
Sometimes, it impacts the family

01:21:18.520 --> 01:21:19.680
may be the marriage is successful

01:21:19.680 --> 01:21:21.280
and she is doing a work

01:21:21.280 --> 01:21:23.240
that might not be important

01:21:23.840 --> 01:21:25.160
and the income is low

01:21:25.640 --> 01:21:29.360
In this case, may be she need

01:21:29.360 --> 01:21:31.880
to dedicate her time to build the family

01:21:32.240 --> 01:21:35.640
She, also, need to have flexibility

01:21:35.640 --> 01:21:39.680
in discussing things with her husband

01:21:39.680 --> 01:21:42.680
to choose the best model for them

01:21:43.160 --> 01:21:44.000
May be there is a model

01:21:44.000 --> 01:21:45.760
that fits you Abu Abdulrahman,

01:21:45.760 --> 01:21:47.080
a model that fits me,

01:21:47.080 --> 01:21:49.280
but not fits other family

01:21:49.560 --> 01:21:54.000
It depends even on location,

01:21:54.000 --> 01:21:59.200
husband income, marriage harmony

01:21:59.200 --> 01:22:02.000
But we cannot say that female work

01:22:02.000 --> 01:22:03.120
is not good for the family

01:22:03.480 --> 01:22:07.720
This makes the woman
in a week position in front of the man,

01:22:07.720 --> 01:22:10.440
and makes her live

01:22:10.440 --> 01:22:12.320
under the man's mercy in some case

01:22:12.800 --> 01:22:16.240
I will conclude this interesting dialogue

01:22:16.800 --> 01:22:18.760
by asking you what message you want

01:22:18.760 --> 01:22:21.280
to convey to a lot of people
who are not happy

01:22:21.280 --> 01:22:23.360
(including my uncle and many others)

01:22:25.040 --> 01:22:27.840
with the social changes accompanying the Visions realization?

01:22:28.520 --> 01:22:30.680
What is your message to them?

01:22:31.640 --> 01:22:32.400
I would say

01:22:32.400 --> 01:22:34.360
that the Vision left its finger prints

01:22:34.360 --> 01:22:35.600
on the Saudi society

01:22:36.080 --> 01:22:39.120
It makes the life wider

01:22:39.720 --> 01:22:40.920
and more pleasant,

01:22:43.360 --> 01:22:45.920
 women became able to practice many activities

01:22:45.920 --> 01:22:47.040
(and so the men)

01:22:47.640 --> 01:22:50.640
I think those people

01:22:50.640 --> 01:22:52.320
do not know much about the Vision;

01:22:52.520 --> 01:22:53.080
and I would advise them

01:22:53.080 --> 01:22:55.520
to read the Vision documents

01:22:55.760 --> 01:22:58.000
and see the achievements.

01:22:58.000 --> 01:22:59.080
Change in general

01:22:59.080 --> 01:23:00.379
They love the old situation

01:23:00.379 --> 01:23:03.440
and do not like change

01:23:04.080 --> 01:23:07.960
What is your comment on the social changes?

01:23:08.480 --> 01:23:11.840
Well studied social changes,

01:23:11.840 --> 01:23:19.400
slow and adaptive is the best model

01:23:19.400 --> 01:23:23.560
Fast changes cause disturbance in values

01:23:23.960 --> 01:23:26.360
and in living models

01:23:26.680 --> 01:23:31.640
This is why gradual change is the best

01:23:32.360 --> 01:23:33.880
This message is in favor of chang

01:23:33.880 --> 01:23:35.440
What about the society

01:23:35.440 --> 01:23:36.640
going through the change…

01:23:37.480 --> 01:23:39.360
What is its role?

01:23:39.360 --> 01:23:41.400
If he looks back on things

01:23:41.400 --> 01:23:43.720
that was not acceptable 2  years ago

01:23:43.720 --> 01:23:45.000
and look at it now

01:23:45.000 --> 01:23:47.000
For example female driving,

01:23:47.600 --> 01:23:49.600
big percentage of the society

01:23:49.920 --> 01:23:52.120
did not accept it, and many even

01:23:52.120 --> 01:23:55.960
did not allow to talk about…

01:23:57.000 --> 01:24:01.040
Now, majority of females are driving;

01:24:01.040 --> 01:24:01.960
and I'm happy about that

01:24:01.960 --> 01:24:05.440
(our driver went home

01:24:05.440 --> 01:24:08.240
and one of my daughters play the role)

01:24:08.960 --> 01:24:11.520
This is a significant achievement

01:24:11.520 --> 01:24:15.760
for the family to dispense private drivers

01:24:16.160 --> 01:24:20.960
I think there might be good changes
that we do not accept

01:24:20.960 --> 01:24:23.920
And this, also, depends on the age

01:24:25.280 --> 01:24:28.520
change adoption varies from person to person

01:24:28.520 --> 01:24:30.760
However, at the same time,

01:24:31.880 --> 01:24:34.960
I hope the Vision as well as the public

01:24:35.240 --> 01:24:41.000
put mechanisms to overcome the challenges

01:24:41.000 --> 01:24:43.760
because there is no change without a price

01:24:44.120 --> 01:24:47.000
We would like to be ready
with minimal damage

01:24:47.000 --> 01:24:49.040
to have a smooth change

01:24:50.280 --> 01:24:53.520
by having institutions,

01:24:54.120 --> 01:24:57.360
supporting the family and its role,

01:24:57.680 --> 01:25:00.600
supporting the mosque, as we mentioned

01:25:00.600 --> 01:25:04.440
and its role,

01:25:04.440 --> 01:25:04.940
universities play its role as well,

01:25:06.760 --> 01:25:09.680
even civil institutions,

01:25:11.360 --> 01:25:17.280
security institutions to adopt

01:25:17.280 --> 01:25:19.760
the change level we are going through

01:25:20.080 --> 01:25:22.280
to protect females and families

01:25:22.640 --> 01:25:24.880
be fully aware

01:25:25.160 --> 01:25:27.400
of how to deal with families…

01:25:27.640 --> 01:25:32.560
I think whoever said this,

01:25:32.560 --> 01:25:35.680
either did not know the Vision achievements,

01:25:36.120 --> 01:25:39.320
or did not think of the situation

01:25:40.200 --> 01:25:41.840
if we do not have the Vision

01:25:42.160 --> 01:25:44.400
How the Saudi society will coop

01:25:44.400 --> 01:25:46.400
with the global changes,

01:25:46.400 --> 01:25:50.240
changes in energy demands

01:25:50.240 --> 01:25:53.120
I think the change came at the right time,

01:25:54.280 --> 01:25:58.840
and rescue the kingdom

01:25:58.840 --> 01:26:02.680
Because citizens depended on

01:26:02.680 --> 01:26:03.360
the government,

01:26:03.920 --> 01:26:06.080
and the productivity was low

01:26:06.080 --> 01:26:07.360
Now,

01:26:08.680 --> 01:26:16.040
shrink government role
the Vision is empowering self-reliance,

01:26:16.040 --> 01:26:18.040
empower productivity,

01:26:21.240 --> 01:26:22.600
in supporting the citizen

01:26:22.600 --> 01:26:24.120
to enable him to be productive

01:26:24.120 --> 01:26:29.080
If the government keeps giving you,

01:26:29.080 --> 01:26:30.960
then the productivity will be low,

01:26:31.120 --> 01:26:33.720
accepting certain professions will be low

01:26:34.000 --> 01:26:34.880
There is no society

01:26:34.880 --> 01:26:35.460
that survive

01:26:35.460 --> 01:26:37.200
while all people working in professions

01:26:37.200 --> 01:26:42.200
are non-citizens

01:26:42.200 --> 01:26:46.760
we can have this luxury,
Maybe in the past

01:26:47.240 --> 01:26:49.920
but in the long term the society

01:26:50.320 --> 01:26:53.760
must change to take responsibility

01:26:54.000 --> 01:27:00.000
where citizens do all kinds of work needed

01:27:00.480 --> 01:27:03.920
and I believe that the Vision encourages this

01:27:05.420 --> 01:27:07.360
establish private business, innovation
It encourage increasing

01:27:07.360 --> 01:27:09.920
the Saudi citizen's productivity,

01:27:10.200 --> 01:27:12.520
not to depend on public sector jobs,

01:27:19.800 --> 01:27:24.240
Innovation is one of the goals

01:27:25.040 --> 01:27:26.800
for human resources development programs

01:27:26.800 --> 01:27:28.400
and one of the Vision goal

01:27:28.400 --> 01:27:29.360
 in general,

01:27:29.600 --> 01:27:33.000
as it motivates the citizen to innovate,

01:27:33.000 --> 01:27:35.680
 and stimulate creative ideas

01:27:36.280 --> 01:27:40.200
I think the Vision is a great achievement

01:27:40.200 --> 01:27:41.825
I will convey this message

01:27:41.825 --> 01:27:43.684
to my uncle and all who questions this

01:27:43.684 --> 01:27:45.200
I'm not sure if I'm convincing,

01:27:45.220 --> 01:27:47.400
but you surprised me with this question,

01:27:47.400 --> 01:27:50.040
I did not think

01:27:50.600 --> 01:27:52.000
of how to answer your uncle!

01:27:52.000 --> 01:27:53.240
++++

01:27:53.240 --> 01:27:54.920
 Maybe I'll meet you and your uncle

01:27:54.920 --> 01:27:57.800
and discuss this

01:27:57.800 --> 01:28:00.000
Will be glad to do this

01:28:00.000 --> 01:28:01.782
We can fly to Howta airport

01:28:01.782 --> 01:28:03.280
and visit you there and have dinner at your home

01:28:03.280 --> 01:28:04.560
That will be an honor for me

01:28:04.560 --> 01:28:05.560
Thank you, Abu Mohammed

01:28:05.560 --> 01:28:06.920
It was a pleasure having you

01:28:06.920 --> 01:28:08.840
It is an honor for me to be with you..

01:28:08.840 --> 01:28:11.360
Thank you for hosting me

01:28:12.240 --> 01:28:13.120
Thank you,

01:28:13.120 --> 01:28:15.000
thanks Rima Marzooq, for preparing this episode,

01:28:15.000 --> 01:28:16.840
thanks Yasir Al Ghanem (the Cameraman)

